# English layout for a new English vault: default path|English path (zones.py; longest prefix wins).
# bootstrap.py, `krouter demo` and first_run.sh lay the template down with it and copy it into the vault as
# krouter-zones.psv. A vault that already exists keeps its own names: nothing here renames a folder.
@lang|en
Agent第二大脑.md|Home.md
01 项目|01 Projects
01 项目/项目.md|01 Projects/Projects.md
01 项目/示例项目|01 Projects/Sample project
01 项目/示例项目/示例项目.md|01 Projects/Sample project/Sample project.md
02 经验与方法|02 Methods
02 经验与方法/经验与方法.md|02 Methods/Methods.md
02 经验与方法/Agent/用户偏好与工作约束.md|02 Methods/Agent/User preferences.md
02 经验与方法/准经验|02 Methods/Provisional
02 经验与方法/准经验/准经验入口.md|02 Methods/Provisional/Provisional.md
02 经验与方法/主题档案|02 Methods/Topics
02 经验与方法/从 claude-mem 导入|02 Methods/From claude-mem
03 资料与证据|03 Sources
03 资料与证据/资料与证据.md|03 Sources/Sources.md
04 已完成与复盘|04 Done
04 已完成与复盘/已完成与复盘.md|04 Done/Done.md
05 时间日志|05 Journal
05 时间日志/时间日志入口.md|05 Journal/Journal.md
05 时间日志/会话摘录|05 Journal/Sessions
05 时间日志/2026-01/01｜示例日.md|05 Journal/2026-01/01｜Sample day.md
90 系统文件|90 System
90 系统文件/状态.md|90 System/Status.md
90 系统文件/Clippings 整理记录.json|90 System/Clippings ledger.json
90 系统文件/Agent记忆|90 System/Agent memory
90 系统文件/Agent记忆/可靠记忆索引.md|90 System/Agent memory/Reliable memory index.md
90 系统文件/Agent记忆/纠错与取代记录.md|90 System/Agent memory/Corrections and replacements.md
90 系统文件/自动化|90 System/Automation
90 系统文件/自动化/日更健康.md|90 System/Automation/Daily health.md
